    "WELLNESS": "Does the item test wellness, cognitive-performance, sleep, meditation, stress, or adjacent claims where clinical and nonclinical interpretations must remain distinct?",
    "WORKPLACE": "Does the item test workplace, occupational, productivity, safety, or monitoring contexts where capability, deployment, intent, and effectiveness require separate evidence?"
